From 376135b26a14267fd08dffb82534b7d2edbb47bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:26:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] surfaceflinger: Compare all render-affecting fields in
 the composition cache

equalIgnoringSource decides whether a cached client composition request can be
reused. It did not compare skipContentDraw, blurRegionTransform or luts. A
layer whose only change was one of those fields was served from the cache
with a stale request, so its blur regions or LUTs were not updated.

Compare the three fields, so a change in any of them misses the cache. Layers
whose render inputs do not change still hit the cache.

Signed-off-by: Omkar Parte <88646966+RAM-UNLOK@users.noreply.github.com>
